  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the kitchen, the Chef finally shows Maks the real, unglamorous ingredients of the famous beef pâté, and Maks is completely shocked by what he sees. Let's listen closely to the conversation in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Паштет говяжий.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Гадость страшная.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Но если всё смешать...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ей нравится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы издеваетесь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Почему?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты самовоспитывался.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну, пойдём.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кстати, хороший паштет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Как делаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что добавлял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Говядина, печень.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around The Secret of the Pâté line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Паштет говяжий.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Beef pâté.' Introducing the true nature of the dish, the phrasing places the focus on the meat type right after naming the spread.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Гадость страшная.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Absolutely revolting.' Barinov grimaces and calls the raw mixture 'frightful filth' to show how unappetizing it looks before cooking.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Но если всё смешать...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But when you mix it all together...' Setting up a surprising contrast, the chef explains what happens if someone were to blend everything into one.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ей нравится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She likes it.' Referring to his pet, he notes that the concoction is pleasing to her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы издеваетесь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you kidding me?' Realizing he was tricked, the frustrated cook asks if he is being mocked or made a fool of.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Почему?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why?' Feigning innocence, the older man offers a one-word question to act as if nothing wrong happened.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты самовоспитывался.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You were learning to discipline yourself.' Framing the cruel joke as a life lesson, the statement implies a process of self-education or personal growth.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну, пойдём.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, let's go.' Dismissing the argument entirely, this casual conversational filler is followed by a prompt to leave the room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кстати, хороший паштет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By the way, it's good pâté.' Changing the subject completely, a transition word meaning \"incidentally\" leads into a genuine compliment about the food.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Как делаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How do you make it?' Showing actual culinary interest, the chef asks about the preparation process using a very direct phrasing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что добавлял?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you put in?' Pushing for recipe details, the question seeks to uncover which extra elements were added to the mix.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Говядина, печень.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Beef, liver.' Still stunned by the revelation, the reply simply lists the two main animal products used in the preparation. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
