    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The Chef shows Maks the real ingredients of the famous pâté. Maks is completely shocked by what he sees. Let us see what happens next in this scene. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'pâté' and 'beef' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
